<title>SRI LANKA: CRICKET-SRI LANKA BOARD XI V INDIA SCOREBOARD.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SRI LANKA BOARD XI V INDIA SCOREBOARD.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scoreboard on the final day of</p>
<p>the three-day match between the Sri Lanka Board President's XI</p>
<p>and India on Thursday:</p>
<p>India first innings 308 (S.Ganguly 79, N.Sidhu 64;</p>
<p>U.Chandana 5-86)</p>
<p>Sri Lanka Board President's XI first innings (overnight</p>
<p>233-6)</p>
<p> R.Arnold c Tenduldkar b Chauhan		 65</p>
